          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "recto, left, Col. I",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>3 (&ldquo;third leaf&rdquo;)</li>\n<li>Sulaym\u0101n the astrologer a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya) (receive)d</li>\n<li>the boy (servant) of Hosha\u02bfna a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya) (receive)d</li>\n<li>_____________________________________</li>\n<li><del>Umm Sha\u1e25\u012bma a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya)</del></li>\n<li>the wife of \u02bfImr\u0101n of Tripoli a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya)</li>\n<li>the wife of b. al-\u1e24all\u0101\u02be a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya) (receive)d</li>\n<li><del>b. al-Baghd\u0101d\u012b a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya)</del></li>\n<li>the mother-in-law of the Kohen a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya) (receive)d</li>\n<li>Yosef b. \u1e24asan a robe (receive)d</li>\n<li><del>Abu&rsquo;l-Faraj the parnas a robe</del></li>\n<li>the enslaved woman <del>j\u016b</del> a j\u016bk\u0101niyya</li>\n<li>b. al-Munajjima a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya)</li>\n<li>the son of Ab\u016b Gh\u0101lib the goldsmith a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya)</li>\n<li><del>the wife of Kar\u012bm of Ti[b]erias a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya)</del></li>\n<li>Ab\u016b \u02bfAl\u012b the blind man a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya)</li>\n<li>the daughters of Ab\u016b Gh\u0101lib the goldsmith a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya)</li>\n<li>Ya\u1e25ya of Bany\u0101s in the house of al-\u02bfIbra[&hellip;] a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya)</li>\n<li>the sister of the parnas from Jerusalem a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya) (receive)d</li>\n<li>the Kohen the blind man in the house of the man from Mal\u012bj a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya)</li>\n<li>a relative of al-Lebd\u012b a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya) (receive)d</li>\n<li><del>the acquaintance of Abu&rsquo;l-\u1e24asan b. al-Shar\u0101b\u012b</del>&nbsp;a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya) (receive)d</li>\n<li>Umm \u1e24ab\u012bb a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya) (receive)d</li>\n<li>the sister of the wife of Menashshe a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya) (receive)d</li>\n<li>the wife of Man\u012bd\u016b a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya) (receive)d</li>\n<li>the house of b. Sutayt a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya) (receive)d</li>\n<li>b. Shiml\u0101\u1e63 a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya) (receive)d</li>\n<li>the man from al-Ma\u1e25alla in [&hellip;] a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya) (receive)d</li>\n<li>the house of b. Shekhanya a shuqqa (receive)d</li>\n<li><del>b. al-Shaw\u012bz\u0101n\u012b</del></li>\n<li>the elder, the acquaintance of Kath\u012br a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya) (receive)d</li>\n<li>the parnas of Damietta a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya) (receive)d</li>\n<li>the wife of the man from Haifa a j\u016bk\u0101n(iyya) (receive)d</li></ol>\n",
